WEBVTT

00:17.267 --> 00:20.228
Kisaki, your double's been turned in.

00:21.062 --> 00:23.148
Now you won't get arrested.

00:27.318 --> 00:29.946
I know Mikey better than anyone.

00:30.989 --> 00:32.532
I've got pride in that.

00:33.616 --> 00:37.162
It's not brains you need to be a leader.

00:37.787 --> 00:38.788
It's looks.

00:39.205 --> 00:43.960
Looks like Mikey's are the superb medium
for becoming a leader.

00:44.836 --> 00:49.299
He shouldn't be
with those people who are in Toman now.

00:49.758 --> 00:52.093
They'll destroy his great potential.

00:53.178 --> 00:58.016
That's why I needed to get involved.

00:59.893 --> 01:01.311
That's pretty arrogant.

01:04.355 --> 01:08.276
To achieve that, I plotted
to have that eyesore Draken killed.

01:08.985 --> 01:12.238
I used Kiyomasa,
who had a grudge against Draken.

01:12.572 --> 01:17.160
But just when he was about to be killed,
someone interfered.

01:18.078 --> 01:19.996
That Takemichi Hanagaki.

01:20.705 --> 01:22.957
He didn't look like such a big deal.

01:23.792 --> 01:26.669
Because of him, my plan failed.

01:27.420 --> 01:31.257
My next plan was
to create the gang Valhalla

01:31.257 --> 01:33.885
and make Mikey their leader.

01:34.469 --> 01:37.680
The one who interfered then
was Keisuke Baji.

01:38.473 --> 01:43.061
That's why I used Kazutora Hanemiya
and persuaded him to kill Baji.

01:43.937 --> 01:45.688
Bloody Halloween, huh?

01:49.359 --> 01:53.071
Anyone who interferes must be eliminated.

01:55.865 --> 01:59.327
No matter what I did,
nothing could satisfy me.

02:00.078 --> 02:04.124
But seeing Mikey lose
what he loved most was thrilling.

02:05.959 --> 02:11.005
Soon, he will be the means
by which I am reborn.

02:11.923 --> 02:13.967
And Emma Sano was the finishing touch?

02:17.262 --> 02:19.389
There's one thing I don't get.

02:19.848 --> 02:23.101
Why would you take the risk
of getting your own hands dirty?

02:24.144 --> 02:26.813
You easily could have used
someone else to kill her.

02:27.522 --> 02:29.649
What prompted you to do that?

02:33.319 --> 02:38.158
I just killed your own sister,
but that's all you care about?

02:41.452 --> 02:43.121
My own sister?

02:45.707 --> 02:48.668
She's not my sister.

02:54.883 --> 02:58.136
I'll come back for you someday, huh?

03:02.807 --> 03:04.726
I spent 10 years in that foster home.

03:05.560 --> 03:09.772
But the only one who came
to visit me was Shinichiro Sano.

03:10.648 --> 03:13.276
The only thing
that filled my empty heart was

03:13.985 --> 03:15.904
his love.

03:16.946 --> 03:21.618
What I care about is
everyone that Shinichiro Sano loved.

03:22.452 --> 03:25.580
Everyone Shinichiro Sano loved,
besides me,

03:26.289 --> 03:28.583
should just die.

03:37.634 --> 03:38.676
Kisaki,

03:39.385 --> 03:42.472
your malice is
what will fulfill my desires.

03:44.432 --> 03:47.227
So I'll let you use me.

03:49.145 --> 03:51.481
Right now, Mikey is just like me.

03:52.023 --> 03:53.691
In the depth of hollowness.

03:55.026 --> 03:58.780
I will tame Mikey myself.

04:00.031 --> 04:03.701
I'll take my time and do it nice and slow.

04:06.621 --> 04:07.664
Kisaki.

04:08.831 --> 04:10.959
Toman's all yours.

04:15.421 --> 04:17.465
<i>What now,</i>

04:18.591 --> 04:19.842
<i>hero?</i>

06:11.079 --> 06:14.248
What the hell... is this?

06:17.960 --> 06:19.212
<i>Draken...</i>

06:53.454 --> 06:54.622
<i>I...</i>

06:55.456 --> 06:56.958
<i>I've got to do something.</i>

07:01.421 --> 07:02.463
Draken...

07:09.345 --> 07:10.680
Mikey,

07:11.431 --> 07:13.057
come outside for a minute.

07:14.434 --> 07:15.435
<i>Draken...</i>

07:30.283 --> 07:31.534
What happened?

07:39.542 --> 07:41.127
How did this happen?

07:50.720 --> 07:53.848
You were there, so how did this happen?

07:58.269 --> 08:00.771
Hey... Mikey.

08:01.606 --> 08:05.693
What the hell were you doing,
you piece of shit?

08:10.406 --> 08:11.741
Draken!

08:12.825 --> 08:14.327
It was my fault!

08:14.327 --> 08:17.455
I was closest to her,
but I failed to protect her!

08:17.914 --> 08:19.707
It's not Mikey's fault!

08:19.707 --> 08:20.917
It's my fault!

08:21.584 --> 08:22.877
So Draken,

08:22.877 --> 08:25.546
if you're going to blame anyone, blame me!

08:25.546 --> 08:30.510
At the grave of his brother Shinichiro,
we ran into Izana Kurokawa.

08:31.052 --> 08:34.138
And Mikey told me
to get Emma away from there.

08:34.597 --> 08:37.266
He left Emma in my care!

08:37.266 --> 08:40.978
So you're hitting the wrong guy
when you hit Mikey.

08:46.984 --> 08:50.863
I thought you made Toman
so you could protect all of us!

08:53.032 --> 08:55.201
Please stop, Draken!

08:55.201 --> 08:58.496
Pah-chin got arrested!

08:58.496 --> 09:00.164
What are you talking about, Draken?

09:01.999 --> 09:03.960
And Baji died!

09:05.753 --> 09:08.631
Kazutora got arrested too!

09:09.966 --> 09:12.009
- Mikey!
- Get off!

09:12.009 --> 09:13.511
And now Emma...

09:25.856 --> 09:27.066
Even Emma...

09:33.948 --> 09:37.285
Get a hold... of yourself...

09:37.785 --> 09:40.204
Draken.

09:44.875 --> 09:46.377
The Draken I know...

09:48.170 --> 09:50.006
The Draken I know has it in him...

09:53.301 --> 09:54.552
to overcome this

09:55.886 --> 09:57.722
and accept what's happened.

10:04.812 --> 10:06.272
<i>Accept this?</i>

10:11.694 --> 10:15.531
<i>There's no way they could accept this.</i>

10:17.617 --> 10:19.869
<i>I want to touch Hina once more.</i>

10:20.870 --> 10:23.080
<i>I want to gaze at Hina once more.</i>

10:24.915 --> 10:26.250
I love you!

10:27.668 --> 10:29.962
<i>Once more, with Hina, I want to...</i>

10:36.427 --> 10:38.262
<i>There's no way they can accept this.</i>

10:40.473 --> 10:42.850
<i>Those two can't return to the past.</i>

10:44.852 --> 10:46.062
<i>Unlike me,</i>

10:46.479 --> 10:51.859
<i>those two can't try to save the people
they love who die in the future.</i>

10:55.821 --> 10:57.031
<i>Mikey...</i>

10:58.032 --> 11:01.327
<i>You were never able to accept it,
were you?</i>

11:02.286 --> 11:04.080
<i>Since you lost everything</i>

11:04.955 --> 11:06.624
<i>and couldn't accept any of it,</i>

11:08.292 --> 11:10.503
<i>you had nowhere to go but down.</i>

11:15.299 --> 11:16.384
<i>It's over.</i>

11:18.177 --> 11:21.681
<i>I can't change that future anymore now.</i>

11:26.143 --> 11:28.521
Hey, man.
It's getting dark.

11:28.896 --> 11:30.398
What's going on?

11:30.398 --> 11:32.483
Aren't we attacking Tenjiku yet?

11:32.483 --> 11:34.985
Let's get this party started, man.

11:35.444 --> 11:38.072
Chifuyu, have you gotten hold of Mikey?

11:38.072 --> 11:39.824
No, I haven't.

11:40.282 --> 11:41.367
I can't get through.

11:41.659 --> 11:42.702
What about Takemichi?

11:43.619 --> 11:45.287
Looks like his phone is off.

11:45.287 --> 11:46.372
Seriously?

11:47.039 --> 11:48.916
What the heck is going on?

11:49.667 --> 11:51.460
I'll go to Takemichi's place.

11:51.460 --> 11:52.545
Me too.

11:56.006 --> 11:57.341
Inui.

11:58.551 --> 11:59.760
Where's Takemitchy?

12:00.219 --> 12:01.554
Weren't you with him?

12:02.555 --> 12:04.014
Some bad shit went down.

12:04.765 --> 12:06.976
- Huh?
- What?

12:17.111 --> 12:18.237
Mikey...

12:19.572 --> 12:20.614
I realize...

12:21.949 --> 12:24.326
it's inconsiderate
to talk about this now...

12:29.999 --> 12:31.876
But today's our showdown with Tenjiku.

12:32.460 --> 12:35.963
Without your orders, Mikey,
we can't make our move.

12:38.424 --> 12:39.717
Mikey...

12:42.678 --> 12:45.097
The one who killed Emma was...

12:46.974 --> 12:48.142
Kisaki.

12:51.270 --> 12:52.980
Knowing him,

12:52.980 --> 12:56.984
he's done something cunning
to make sure he doesn't get caught.

12:58.986 --> 13:00.321
Mikey...

13:01.739 --> 13:04.366
I'll fight Tenjiku
even if I have to do it alone.

13:20.674 --> 13:24.011
<i>Even if it's me alone,
I've got to keep moving forward.</i>

13:33.395 --> 13:35.064
Oh.

14:02.758 --> 14:03.759
<i>Hina...</i>

14:05.344 --> 14:06.720
Emma!

14:07.805 --> 14:09.723
No!

14:10.391 --> 14:12.560
This can't be real!

14:20.651 --> 14:21.902
Don't cry,

14:22.695 --> 14:23.779
Hina.

14:29.243 --> 14:31.871
I'm right here with you, see?

14:34.290 --> 14:37.251
Takemichi!

14:37.251 --> 14:40.045
What's the matter?
Why don't you tell me about it?

14:40.713 --> 14:42.756
Takemichi!

14:42.756 --> 14:44.258
There, there.

14:45.634 --> 14:47.428
That's not funny, Takemichi!

14:57.646 --> 14:59.356
When I was 21,

15:00.482 --> 15:02.735
I worked as a department store janitor.

15:05.696 --> 15:07.865
This one kid kept getting lost.

15:09.199 --> 15:11.452
I did this to distract the kid,

15:12.703 --> 15:14.830
but the kid cried even more.

15:16.081 --> 15:17.833
I'll protect you.

15:21.587 --> 15:22.630
I know it's dumb.

15:24.131 --> 15:25.132
But this...

15:26.258 --> 15:27.927
This is me at age 26.

15:28.761 --> 15:30.930
A hopeless, idiotic flake.

15:31.764 --> 15:33.933
I lived my days in a haze.

15:35.142 --> 15:36.602
Even though

15:37.561 --> 15:39.563
something horrible like this had happened.

15:41.273 --> 15:42.566
I didn't know a thing.

15:44.068 --> 15:45.861
I always ran from what hurt.

15:47.279 --> 15:48.739
<i>I ran and ran.</i>

15:49.239 --> 15:51.617
<i>I spent my whole life running away.</i>

15:57.373 --> 15:59.166
I'm going now.

16:00.501 --> 16:02.294
There are still things I can do.

16:05.631 --> 16:07.967
Heroes don't run away.

16:09.259 --> 16:12.304
You see, I want to see you smile.

16:19.812 --> 16:21.313
<i>I will protect you.</i>

16:24.692 --> 16:27.569
<i>Even if I die today doing it.</i>

16:29.530 --> 16:32.866
<i>Let's finish this, Kisaki!</i>

16:37.496 --> 16:38.497
Chifuyu...

16:39.206 --> 16:40.332
Get on.

16:40.708 --> 16:41.792
Everyone's waiting.

16:48.340 --> 16:49.967
Listen up, everyone!

16:50.801 --> 16:51.885
Shut up!

16:52.469 --> 16:54.138
Hey! Listen up!

16:54.430 --> 16:55.431
Listen!

16:56.015 --> 16:57.016
What's with him?

16:57.016 --> 16:59.143
You telling us what to do, Chifuyu?

16:59.143 --> 17:03.355
Today, our leader's sister died.

17:03.355 --> 17:05.315
- What?
- Seriously?

17:05.899 --> 17:07.359
Mikey's sister?

17:07.359 --> 17:08.444
How come?

17:08.444 --> 17:10.029
Is the leader okay?

17:10.029 --> 17:11.905
How'd that happen?

17:11.905 --> 17:13.240
What happened?

17:13.240 --> 17:15.242
- How about Draken?
- Are they okay?

17:15.576 --> 17:16.744
How's the leader?

17:16.744 --> 17:19.538
Our leader and vice-leader are okay.

17:19.538 --> 17:20.622
But obviously,

17:20.622 --> 17:23.959
our leader can't participate
in today's fight against Tenjiku.

17:24.543 --> 17:25.961
Same with the vice-leader.

17:26.795 --> 17:27.921
What'll we do?

17:28.338 --> 17:32.217
Without our two top guys,
how are we supposed to fight?

17:32.217 --> 17:33.385
That's right.

17:34.803 --> 17:37.139
An army without a king is just a rabble.

17:37.723 --> 17:39.183
We'll lose for sure.

17:40.976 --> 17:43.687
We shouldn't fight today.

17:44.188 --> 17:45.773
Yeah, he's right.

17:45.773 --> 17:47.816
This isn't the time for a battle.

17:47.816 --> 17:49.568
We should probably back out.

17:49.568 --> 17:51.695
We've already lost too many people.

17:51.695 --> 17:56.366
Without Mikey and Draken,
we're in no condition to get in a fight.

17:57.076 --> 17:58.285
I'll admit,

17:58.285 --> 18:02.039
we have a better chance if we
back off today and prep for another day.

18:02.664 --> 18:03.749
But...

18:05.542 --> 18:08.337
Toman is going after Tenjiku today!

18:11.256 --> 18:14.134
- What?
- What a load of crap!

18:14.134 --> 18:17.679
Toman ain't doing anything
without Mikey here!

18:17.679 --> 18:19.765
Since when are you in charge of Toman?

18:19.765 --> 18:21.767
Quit acting so cocky!

18:21.767 --> 18:23.644
You may be captain of First Division,

18:23.644 --> 18:25.312
but you're still a newbie!

18:25.312 --> 18:27.898
Do you think you can fill Baji's shoes?

18:27.898 --> 18:30.192
If you want to fight, fight them alone!

18:30.192 --> 18:32.027
This is total bullshit!

18:32.152 --> 18:33.278
I'm out of here!

18:33.278 --> 18:36.240
At the very least, we should wait
for our leader and vice-leader.

18:36.240 --> 18:37.991
This meeting's over!

18:40.661 --> 18:42.704
Well, I figured this would happen.

18:43.664 --> 18:45.207
Everyone's right.

18:46.291 --> 18:48.710
But even if we back off today,

18:49.211 --> 18:52.756
Tenjiku will try to crush Toman
in even more underhanded ways.

18:53.340 --> 18:55.801
Either way,
we'll be playing into Kisaki's hands.

18:57.052 --> 18:58.345
<i>It can't be helped.</i>

18:59.012 --> 19:00.931
<i>I planned on going alone anyway.</i>

19:02.724 --> 19:04.768
So, what'll you do?

19:05.686 --> 19:09.231
Even if I have to go alone,
there's no way I can back down.

19:11.650 --> 19:13.026
That's what I thought.

19:14.278 --> 19:16.530
Then a double suicide it is.

19:18.240 --> 19:19.366
Chifuyu...

19:21.994 --> 19:23.036
I'm sorry.

19:26.498 --> 19:27.875
It's not just you two!

19:28.375 --> 19:30.586
I'm going with you, Takemichi!

19:30.586 --> 19:31.712
Akkun!

19:32.671 --> 19:34.089
It's always been this way.

19:34.798 --> 19:37.176
The only one who never runs
is Takemichi!

19:44.766 --> 19:45.893
I'm going too!

19:46.185 --> 19:47.311
Me too!

19:47.311 --> 19:48.395
Me too.

19:48.812 --> 19:51.398
Let's take on Tenjiku together!

19:52.316 --> 19:53.525
You guys...

19:55.235 --> 19:59.615
This Takemitchy,
he never picks a fight he can win.

19:59.740 --> 20:01.241
- What?
- No way!

20:02.743 --> 20:05.162
I snuck out of the hospital.

20:05.162 --> 20:06.622
Smiley!

20:07.080 --> 20:09.166
Takemitchy's such a moron.

20:09.875 --> 20:11.793
That's why he never runs away.

20:14.880 --> 20:15.923
Mitsuya!

20:16.715 --> 20:19.218
Bring these two along with you.

20:22.179 --> 20:25.849
Takemitchy, you won't have to carry
Toman's burden alone.

20:26.225 --> 20:28.143
Right? Lifesaver.

20:28.727 --> 20:29.811
Angry.

20:30.646 --> 20:31.855
Hakkai.

20:34.399 --> 20:35.651
You guys...

20:35.651 --> 20:37.361
Have you lost your minds?

20:40.864 --> 20:42.157
We haven't got a chance.

20:42.658 --> 20:45.535
But if we run away now, Toman's through!

20:47.329 --> 20:51.208
If we want to remain who we are,
we've got no choice but to prove it!

20:52.751 --> 20:55.629
That even if we don't have Mikey
with us...

20:55.629 --> 20:56.838
- Yeah!
- Yeah!

20:56.838 --> 20:59.925
Toman will not lose!

21:06.390 --> 21:08.767
Toman! Toman!

21:08.767 --> 21:14.523
- Toman! Toman! Toman...
- Toman! Toman! Toman...

21:14.523 --> 21:17.150
After all,
no matter what anyone here says,

21:17.442 --> 21:19.152
we all love Toman.

21:20.279 --> 21:21.321
Chifuyu,

21:22.281 --> 21:25.158
I'm going to save Emma and Baji too.

21:25.158 --> 21:26.243
Huh?

21:27.119 --> 21:29.079
I don't know how I'll do it.

21:29.788 --> 21:33.458
But if I can do something
as absurd as traveling through time,

21:34.001 --> 21:35.711
then nothing is impossible.

21:36.628 --> 21:39.881
To achieve that,
I've got to crush Tenjiku first,

21:40.382 --> 21:42.467
defeat Izana Kurokawa,

21:42.467 --> 21:45.679
and pummel Tetta Kisaki,
the guy who's using him.

21:47.097 --> 21:50.225
I won't let things end like this!

21:51.643 --> 21:52.686
<i>Let's go!</i>

23:34.329 --> 23:35.705
Right here, tonight,

23:36.498 --> 23:37.999
we will change history.

23:38.917 --> 23:40.919
Translated by Brian Athey
